### Storefront API — IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client scratchpad
### Run "login (demo)" first; {{demoToken}} / {{adminToken}} are captured from the response.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### login (demo) -> customer token
# @name loginDemo
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@storefront.test", "password": "demo12345" }

> {% client.global.set("demoToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### login (admin) -> admin token
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@storefront.test", "password": "admin12345" }

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### register a brand-new account
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "newbuyer@example.com", "password": "password123", "fullName": "New Buyer" }

### browse catalogue (public)
GET {{host}}/api/catalog/products

### browse one category
GET {{host}}/api/catalog/products?category=electronics

### categories
GET {{host}}/api/catalog/categories

### create a product (ADMIN only -> 403 with demo token)
POST {{host}}/api/catalog/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "BK-9001", "name": "The Rust Book", "description": "Systems programming.",
  "priceCents": 3200, "currency": "USD", "categorySlug": "books", "stockQuantity": 25 }

### place an order — happy path -> CONFIRMED after a moment
# @name placeOrder
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{demoToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 } ] }

> {% client.global.set("orderRef", response.body.orderRef); %}

### poll the order
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderRef}}
Authorization: Bearer {{demoToken}}

### list my orders
GET {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{demoToken}}

### rejection path — quantity above stock -> REJECTED (Out of stock: ...)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{demoToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 99999 } ] }

### payment-limit path — total >= $10,000 -> REJECTED (Payment declined: amount too large)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{demoToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": 3, "quantity": 95 } ] }
